{"lines": ["On the night of November 22nd, 1987, two Chicago television stations were hijacked, two hours apart.", "At about 9:14, during a sports segment on WGN, the screen went black.", "Then a person in a Max Headroom mask appeared, swaying in front of a metal panel, with only a loud buzz for sound.", "Engineers cut it off by changing the frequency of the link to their transmitter. It lasted well under a minute.", "Around 11:20, it happened again, on the public station WTTW, during an episode of Doctor Who.", "This time the pirates got audio, and stayed on the air for about ninety seconds.", "The masked figure rambled about nerds, held up a soda can, and ended by showing his bare backside before the signal ended.", "The FCC investigated and could not find the people responsible.", "Thousands of homes in Chicago had seen it, and decades later, the perpetrators have never been identified.", "For a few seconds, a stranger had taken over the airwaves of a city.", "And the strangest signal of all was caught by a student, who thought it might be someone like us."], "words": [["On", 0.0, 0.08], ["the", 0.08, 0.18], ["night", 0.18, 0.36], ["of", 0.36, 0.52], ["November", 0.52, 0.84], ["22nd,", 0.84, 2.08], ["1987,", 2.18, 3.24], ["two", 4.24, 4.48], ["Chicago", 4.48, 4.92], ["television", 4.92, 5.38], ["stations", 5.38, 5.98], ["were", 5.98, 6.46], ["hijacked,", 6.46, 6.82], ["two", 7.34, 7.56], ["hours", 7.56, 7.9], ["apart.", 7.9, 8.22], ["At", 8.88, 9.0], ["about", 9.0, 9.2], ["9:14,", 9.2, 10.96], ["during", 10.96, 11.18], ["a", 11.18, 11.3], ["sports", 11.3, 11.52], ["segment", 11.52, 12.0], ["on", 12.0, 12.26], ["WGN,", 12.26, 12.98], ["the", 13.58, 13.64], ["screen", 13.64, 13.94], ["went", 13.94, 14.28], ["black.", 14.28, 14.68], ["Then", 15.2, 15.34], ["a", 15.34, 15.42], ["person", 15.42, 15.82], ["in", 15.82, 16.02], ["a", 16.02, 16.1], ["Max", 16.1, 16.32], ["Headroom", 16.32, 16.82], ["mask", 16.82, 17.14], ["appeared,", 17.14, 17.6], ["swaying", 18.16, 18.6